iphonebridge (0.13.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Notifications can be dismissed from either end: the app clears them
    on the iPhone via the ANCS negative action, and clearing one on the
    iPhone removes it from the app.
  * The status page no longer reports app notifications working while
    the phone is disconnected.

 -- santisbon <santisbon@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 26 Aug 2026 15:50:53 -0500

