  * The man pages now carry the package version, substituted from this
    changelog at build time; 0.12.0's still said 0.11.0.

 -- santisbon <santisbon@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 26 Aug 2026 13:10:54 -0500

iphonebridge (0.12.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Per-app notifications (ANCS) are now attainable: ancs-enable steers
    the connection over BLE instead of an approach that undid itself, and
    doctor probes BLE advertising and the ANCS bond. Ships man pages.
    See CHANGELOG.md.

 -- santisbon <santisbon@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 26 Aug 2026 13:01:29 -0500

iphonebridge (0.11.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The interface is styled after Apple's, and now follows the desktop's
    font size instead of a fixed one. Emoji are legible. The Setup tab is
    renamed Status and rebuilt as a settings-style list. Fixes starting a
    new conversation leaving the previous one on screen. See CHANGELOG.md.

 -- santisbon <santisbon@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 26 Aug 2026 01:28:39 -0500

iphonebridge (0.10.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The desktop app is rebuilt on Qt 6 / QML, replacing GTK4/libadwaita.
    Dependencies change accordingly. Message and app notifications now
    clear themselves after ten seconds. A conversation with your own
    number no longer splits in two. See CHANGELOG.md.

 -- santisbon <santisbon@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 25 Aug 2026 22:31:25 -0500

